    "title": "Hiring Store Manager at Khadim's Capital India",
    "description": "Join the Khadim's Capital India family as a Store Manager in Mysuru. We believe in empowering our employees with the tools, training, and environment they need to succeed.\n\nAbout Khadim's Capital India:\nKhadim's Capital India is a leading organization in the Remote sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Ensure visual merchandising standards are maintained at all times\n• Handle customer queries, complaints, and escalations effectively\n• Coordinate with the supply chain team for timely stock delivery\n• Implement promotional activities and in-store campaigns\n• Build relationships with regular customers to drive loyalty\n• Manage store operations to ensure smooth daily functioning\n• Conduct regular stock audits and prevent pilferage\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• Chartered Accountant (ICAI)\n• 6-10 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Planogram\n• Proficiency in SAP Retail\n• Proficiency in Inventory Management\n• Proficiency in E-commerce Integration\n• Proficiency in Customer Service\n• Proficiency in Retail Analytics\n• Proficiency in Loyalty Programs\n• Proficiency in Omnichannel Retail\n\nWork Mode: Remote - Work from anywhere in India\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Transportation and conveyance allowance\n• Annual performance appraisal\n• Meal coupons and food allowance\n• Flexible working hours\n• Employee stock options (ESOPs) for eligible roles\n• Company-sponsored certifications\n• Salary Range: 12 LPA - 25 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Mysuru, Karnataka, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Khadim's Capital India!",
